    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e18da2a343498fc02649fe10ee8d7b08.poster.avif?t=1755581673\" width=600 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e18da2a343498fc02649fe10ee8d7b08.webm?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e18da2a343498fc02649fe10ee8d7b08.mp4?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e6aa3c0a582e3ee7325f3e10a6581e68.poster.avif?t=1755581673\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e6aa3c0a582e3ee7325f3e10a6581e68.webm?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e6aa3c0a582e3ee7325f3e10a6581e68.mp4?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Background</strong><br>The Wheel of Reincarnation in this world has been corrupted by polluted spiritual energy, transforming into an AI entity. Through advanced AI technology, it has broken the boundaries of life's end, merging flesh, soul, and machinery to form a new life system. However, the surviving humans and demonic races do not accept this practice. The protagonist will explore this world where remnants of humanity, mechanical AI, and demons coexist, uncovering the conflicts and entanglements among various factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/54ac57a5dfff88ea1a4d6f3703eb3d21.poster.avif?t=1755581673\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/54ac57a5dfff88ea1a4d6f3703eb3d21.webm?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/54ac57a5dfff88ea1a4d6f3703eb3d21.mp4?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Setting</strong><br>This game is the final installment in the <i>Liuyin</i> trilogy, adopting a <i>Chinese fantasy cyberpunk</i> style to complete the series' overarching\u4e16\u754c\u89c2 (worldview).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/2b0770dcaa43c902e963a199570fcca7.poster.avif?t=1755581673\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/2b0770dcaa43c902e963a199570fcca7.webm?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/2b0770dcaa43c902e963a199570fcca7.mp4?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat System</strong><br>The game emphasizes aggressive play and counter-defense mechanics. In addition to standard actions like blocking and dodging, it enhances the series' exploration-based collection system, featuring <i>2 sets of martial arts</i> and <i>1 passive skill system</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/f2c93465c97ccad76f282420c0584e13.poster.avif?t=1755581673\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/f2c93465c97ccad76f282420c0584e13.webm?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/f2c93465c97ccad76f282420c0584e13.mp4?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment System</strong><br>The game introduces <i>weapons</i>, <i>soul firearms</i>, and <i>cloak equipment</i>. Players can obtain new gear with unique traits by defeating bosses or exploring, significantly improving replayability.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/836d93d5957e1c4e046592debbcfe42f.poster.avif?t=1755581673\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/836d93d5957e1c4e046592debbcfe42f.webm?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/836d93d5957e1c4e046592debbcfe42f.mp4?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Level Design</strong><br>Levels are intricately designed with labyrinthine <i>box-style layouts</i>, creating a sense of progression and discovery. There are <i>8 major zones</i> with distinct themes and numerous smaller areas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endings</strong><br>The game features <i>multiple branching paths and endings</i>, encouraging players to replay for different outcomes.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e18da2a343498fc02649fe10ee8d7b08.poster.avif?t=1755581673\" width=600 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e18da2a343498fc02649fe10ee8d7b08.webm?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e18da2a343498fc02649fe10ee8d7b08.mp4?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e6aa3c0a582e3ee7325f3e10a6581e68.poster.avif?t=1755581673\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e6aa3c0a582e3ee7325f3e10a6581e68.webm?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3689510/extras/e6aa3c0a582e3ee7325f3e10a6581e68.mp4?t=1755581673\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game Background</strong><br>The Wheel of Reincarnation in this world has been corrupted by polluted spiritual energy, transforming into an AI entity. Through advanced AI technology, it has broken the boundaries of life's end, merging flesh, soul, and machinery to form a new life system. However, the surviving humans and demonic races do not accept this practice. The protagonist will explore this world where remnants of humanity, mechanical AI, and demons coexist, uncovering the conflicts and entanglements among various factions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsin