    "short_description": "A 3D cyber-fantasy ARPG with metroidvania levels &amp; multiple endings. Combat rewards aggression \u2013 hesitation means defeat. In a world where the Wheel of Reincarnation, corrupted by tainted energy, became an AI that merged flesh, souls, and machines to create new life, survivors reject this evolution.",
